From bde36ebe4cb88c569ae5fb3bbd0cff3050d6bff9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Afranji <afranji@google.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Jun 2024 01:59:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 91/98] KVM: selftests: TDX: Add shared memory test

Adds a test that sets up shared memory between the host and guest.

Co-developed-by: Binbin Wu <binbin.wu@linux.intel.com>
Signed-off-by: Binbin Wu <binbin.wu@linux.intel.com>
Signed-off-by: Ryan Afranji <afranji@google.com>
