  from comment that does not use kerneldoc formatting.

- Reinette: Squash fix from Isaku that quiets handle_memory_conversion() by
  using pr_debug() instead of printf(). It's too noisy to use printf() on
  every handle_memory_conversion() call.

- Reinette: switch to reverse fir where practical
